data/
# Leading slash matters: this is the working directory `bugdb fetch` writes
# into at the repo root. Unanchored, the pattern also swallowed
# `src/bugdb/templates/assets/`, so any NEW template asset was silently
# ignored (app.js and tailwind.css only survive because they predate the
# rule).
/assets/

